# core.autocrlf is true on this machine, so a checkout rewrote index.html to
# CRLF while the generators emit LF. That made `build_pages.py --check` report
# index.html as stale immediately after `git checkout main`, which is a false
# alarm in the one tool that exists to catch real staleness.
#
# Committed blobs were already LF; this just stops the working tree drifting.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending processed.
*.png binary
*.ico binary
*.jpg binary
*.avif binary
*.zip binary
